  "idea": "How to turn any website into a standalone desktop app on your computer",
  "text": "This two-click browser setting turns any website into an independent desktop icon on your computer. Hunting through dozens of open tabs to locate your project board constantly breaks your deep focus. Running web apps inside cluttered browser windows creates severe memory lag and hides urgent notification badges. In Chrome or Edge, click More Tools, select Create Shortcut, and check Open as Window. You launch tools in distraction-free windows instantly.",
